<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>MENEM | Leandro Bruno</title>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Manrope:wght@200;400;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <style>
        :root { --bg: #000; --text: #fff; --gray: #888; }
        body { background-color: var(--bg); color: var(--text); font-family: 'Manrope', sans-serif; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
        
        nav { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; padding: 40px 5%; align-items: center; }
        .logo img { height: 50px; width: auto; }
        .menu a { text-decoration: none; color: var(--gray); margin-left: 30px; font-size: 0.7rem; letter-spacing: 2px; text-transform: uppercase; }
        .menu a:hover { color: #fff; }

        .container { padding: 0 5%; max-width: 1400px; margin: 0 auto; }

        /* Video Principal */
        .video-container { 
            width: 100%; 
            aspect-ratio: 16/9; 
            background: #111; 
            margin-bottom: 60px;
        }
        iframe { width: 100%; height: 100%; border: none; }

        /* Info del Proyecto estilo Armaleo */
        .project-info { display: flex; flex-direction: column; margin-bottom: 100px; }
        .project-title { font-size: 1.8rem; letter-spacing: 8px; text-transform: uppercase; margin-bottom: 30px; font-weight: 400; }
        
        .details-grid { 
            display: grid; 
            grid-template-columns: 1.5fr 1fr; 
            gap: 80px; 
            border-top: 1px solid #222; 
            padding-top: 30px; 
        }

        .description { font-size: 1rem; color: #ccc; line-height: 1.8; font-weight: 200; }
        .credits { font-size: 0.75rem; color: var(--gray); text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 2px; line-height: 2.2; }
        .credits b { color: #fff; font-weight: 400; margin-right: 10px; }

        footer { padding: 80px 0 40px 0; font-size: 9px; color: #333; letter-spacing: 2px; text-transform: uppercase; }
        
        @media (max-width: 768px) {
            .details-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 40px; }
            .project-title { font-size: 1.2rem; }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <nav>
        <div class="logo">
            <a href="index.html"><img src="LOGO_Manrope_v01.png" alt="Leandro Bruno"></a>
        </div>
        <div class="menu">
            <a href="index.html">WORK</a>
            <a href="#">ABOUT</a>
            <a href="mailto:leandrobrunoeditor@gmail.com">CONTACT</a>
        </div>
    </nav>

    <div class="container">
        <div class="video-container">
            <iframe src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/-2AmqmciWXE?autoplay=0&rel=0&showinfo=0" allowfullscreen></iframe>
        </div>

        <div class="project-info">
            <h1 class="project-title">MENEM</h1>
            
            <div class="details-grid">
                <div class="description">
                    <p>Serie documental que explora el ascenso al poder y el impacto social y económico de la presidencia de Carlos Saúl Menem en la Argentina de los años 90. Un relato visual que combina material de archivo inédito y testimonios clave.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="credits">
                    CLIENT: <b>AMAZON PRIME VIDEO</b><br>
                    ROLE: <b>EDITOR</b><br>
                    PRODUCTION: <b>CAPA / CLAXSON</b><br>
                    YEAR: <b>2024</b>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <footer>© 2026 LEANDRO BRUNO.</footer>
    </div>

</body>
</html>
